        {
          "block_id": "b00068",
          "quote": "In the hippocampal slices (control n ¼ 9, WhB 60 n ¼ 7, WhB 15 n ¼ 8, Slice n ¼ 7), whole-body exposure enhanced the efficacy of LTP induction, especially in the WhB 15 group."
